[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mSeeded users + switcher (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246m2-3 demo users and an "acting as" control. Changes attributed to the active user; you're notified about others' [39m
     [38;5;246mchanges. Demonstrable and testable today.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Single user, suppress self-changes
     [38;5;246mCorrect semantics, but nothing ever notifies until a backend exists. Tests still need a fabricated actor.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Single user, notify on own edits
     [38;5;246mSimplest code. Every change notifies you, including your own — wrong UX from day one and hides whether subscription
[39m     [38;5;246mlogic works.[39m
